    "intro": "You are in the lower reaches of the music industry, and there are few who believe you can manage a Top 10 hit, stacking the odds up against you completing the Rock Manager journey to fame and fortune found in the upper echelons of the music industry.\n   Prove them wrong, get a Top 10 hit!",
